  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant TRAVERSAL_TYPE has the value 7</p>
  <p>Used in combination with one of the traversal type flags. The default is <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/w/index.php?title=TRAVERSAL_TYPE_SLOW&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1" target="_blank">TRAVERSAL_TYPE_SLOW</a>, other options are <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/w/index.php?title=TRAVERSAL_TYPE_FAST&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1" target="_blank">TRAVERSAL_TYPE_FAST</a> and <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/w/index.php?title=TRAVERSAL_TYPE_NONE&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1" target="_blank">TRAVERSAL_TYPE_NONE</a>.</p>
</p>
    </div>

